d4531250c37c5d3f9e.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">左边</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3757058137874432/6706fe00b4e231e62d9ecbec567d526b.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">右边，</span></p><p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">即</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3757058137874432/2166e961e2112ad8f9e828b35a693bef.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．</span></p>"
