{
  "html" : "<p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Throughout my life, I’ve been on a journey to discover what truly matters. Like many people, I used to measure success by external standards — grades, salaries, and social status. But a series of </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"1\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　1　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> changed my perspective completely.</span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>When I was 25, I </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"2\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　2　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> a high-paying job in finance. Everyone congratulated me, but I soon realized money alone couldn’t bring happiness. Each morning, I’d wake up feeling </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"3\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　3　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>, as if something important was missing from my life. This emptiness led me to </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"4\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　4　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> volunteer work at a local shelter. There, I met people who had almost nothing yet radiated more joy than many wealthy individuals I knew.</span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>One elderly man particularly </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"5\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　5　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> me. Despite living in poverty, he spent his days teaching neighborhood children to read. When I asked why, he simply said, “This is how I </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"6\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　6　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> my life meaningful.” His words struck me deeply. I began to </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"7\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　7　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> my own values and priorities.</span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Over time, I </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"8\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　8　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> that true fulfillment comes from contributing to something larger than yourself. I left my finance job and </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"9\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　9　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> a nonprofit organization focused on education. The work is challenging, and the pay is modest, but I’ve never felt more </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"10\"' size='\"12\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　10　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>. My definition of success has completely transformed—it’s no longer about accumulation but about </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"11\"' size='\"12\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　11　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>.</span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>This journey taught me that we all have a unique </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"12\"' size='\"12\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　12　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> to play in this world. The key is to listen to your inner </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"13\"' size='\"12\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　13　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> rather than external expectations. When you line up your actions with your core values, you’ll find the courage to pursue paths that may seem </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"14\"' size='\"12\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　14　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> to others but feel perfectly right to you.</span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Now, when young people ask me for </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"15\"' size='\"12\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　15　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> about finding their purpose, I tell them: “Don’t rush. The answers will come when you’re ready to hear them.”</span></p>",
