source.formattedExplanation:
{
  "explanationSegs" : [ {
    "name" : "导语",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">本文是一篇记叙文。文章讲述了作者从追求外在成功标准到发现真正的人生价值的心路历程，强调了贡献和内在声音的重要性。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(1)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查名词词义辨析。句意：但一系列的经历彻底改变了我的看法。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. accidents</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">事故；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. experiences</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">经历；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. theories</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">理论；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. competitions</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">比赛。根据前文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>I used to measure success by external standards</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”以及作者描述的具体生活转变可知，是“经历”改变了作者的观点。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(2)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查动词词义辨析。句意：</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>25</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">岁时，我获得了一份高薪的金融工作。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. refused</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">拒绝；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. created</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">创造；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. secured</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">获得；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. described</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">描述。根据后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Everyone congratulated me</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>secured a job</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”为固定搭配，意为“找到工作”，作者是“获得”了一份高薪工作。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(3)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查形容词词义辨析。句意：每天早上醒来，我都感到空虚，仿佛生活中缺少了重要的东西。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. energetic</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">精力充沛的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. empty</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">空虚的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. confident</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">自信的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. peaceful</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">平静的。根据后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>as if something important was missing from my life</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，高薪工作并未带来满足感，反而让作者感到“空虚”，后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>this emptiness</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”也为原词复现。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(4)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查动词词义辨析。句意：这种空虚感促使我去探索当地的收容所的志愿工作。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. avoid</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">避免；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. consider</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考虑；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. postpone</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">推迟；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. explore</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">探索。根据后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>volunteer work at a local shelter</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，作者因内心空虚而开始“探索”志愿工作，试图寻找意义。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(5)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查动词词义辨析。句意：一位老人尤其让我印象深刻。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. ignored</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">忽视；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. followed</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">跟随；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. frightened</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">使害怕；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. impressed</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">给……留下印象。根据后文老人教孩子读书的行为，以及后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>His words struck me deeply</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，老人给作者留下了深刻印象。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(6)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查动词词义辨析。句意：当我问他为什么时，他只是说：“这就是我让我的生活有意义的方式。”</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. make</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">使；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. keep</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">保持；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. take</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">拿；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. find</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">发现。根据后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>my life meaningful</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>make life meaningful</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”为固定搭配，意为“使生活有意义”，符合老人通过教书实现自我价值的语境。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(7)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查动词词义辨析。句意：我开始质疑自己的价值观和优先级。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. believe</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">相信；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. defend</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">辩护；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. question</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">质疑；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. explain</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">解释。根据前文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>When I asked why, he simply said, “This is how I ____6____ my life meaningful.”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，老人的话让作者反思过去的追求，因此作者开始“质疑”自己原本的价值观。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(8)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查动词词义辨析。句意：随着时间的推移，我意识到真正的满足来自于为比自己更伟大的事情做出贡献。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. predicted</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">预测；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. remembered</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">记得；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. realized</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">意识到；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. promised</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">承诺。根据后文作者的行动转变“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>left my finance job</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”以及“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>true fulfillment comes from contributing to something larger than yourself.</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”，通过经历和反思可知，他“意识到”了重要道理。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(9)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查动词短语辨析。句意：我辞去了金融工作，成立了一个专注于教育的非营利组织。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. set up</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">建立；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. applied for</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">申请；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. make up</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">编造；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. called for</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">呼吁。根据后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>a nonprofit organization</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，作者离开金融行业后“建立”了公益组织，体现其行动上的转变。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(10)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查形容词词义辨析。句意：这项工作很有挑战性，薪水也不高，但我从未感到如此充实。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. anxious</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">焦虑的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. fulfilled</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">充实的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. confused</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">困惑的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. disappointed</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">失望的。根据前文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Over time, I ____8____ that true fulfillment comes from contributing to something larger than yourself.</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”及转折关系可知，作者感到“充实”。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(11)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查名词词义辨析。句意：我的成功定义已经完全转变</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>——</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">不再是关于积累，而是关于贡献。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. contribution</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">贡献；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. possession</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">拥有；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. promotion</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">晋升；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. recognition</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">认可。根据前文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Over time, I ____8____ that true fulfillment comes from contributing to something larger than yourself.</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，作者认为成功的核心是“贡献”，而非物质积累。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(12)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查名词词义辨析。句意：这段旅程让我明白，我们在这个世界上都有独特的角色要扮演。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. game</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">游戏；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. joke</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">玩笑；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. trick</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">诡计；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. role</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">角色。根据后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>to play in this world</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>play a role</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”为固定搭配，意为“扮演角色”，指每个人在世界上都有独特的价值，此处指“角色”。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(13)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查名词词义辨析。句意：关键是倾听你内心的声音，而不是外界的期望。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. music</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">音乐；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. lesson</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">课程；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. voice</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">声音；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. part</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">部分。根据常见表达“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>inner voice</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”，即“内心声音”，以及与后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>rather than external expectations</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”形成对比可知，此处强调听从内在的“声音”，呼应作者追随内心的主题。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(14)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查形容词词义辨析。句意：当你使自己的行动与核心价值观一致时，你会找到勇气去追求那些对他人来说可能看似冒险，但对你来说完全正确的道路。</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. easy</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">容易的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. risky</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">冒险的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. boring</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">无聊的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. expensive</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">昂贵的。根据后文“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>but feel perfectly right to you</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”可知，作者辞去高薪工作投身公益，在他人眼中可能是“有风险的”，但符合自己的价值观。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(15)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">考查名词词义辨析。句意：现在，当年轻人向我寻求关于找到人生目标的建议时，我告诉他们：“不要急。答案会在你准备好时出现。”</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A. money</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">钱；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B. equipment</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">设备；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C. permission</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">许可；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D. advice</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">建议。根据后文作者的回答“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>I tell them: “Don’t rush.</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”以及“</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>finding their purpose</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">”的语境可知，年轻人是在寻求“建议”。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>D</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">项。</span></p>"
  } ]
}

