  "html" : "<p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>There’s an autumn day that I recall every time I feel anxious. I was a teenager at the time, </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"1\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　1　　　　</span><span> in my studies and the pressure of upcoming college applications. It was my </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"2\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　2　　　　</span><span>, Mr. Jensen, who brought me back to earth.</span></span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>Mr. Jensen was a quiet man in his seventies who lived alone in the house next door. Despite our </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"3\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　3　　　　</span><span> difference we had a shared love for gardening, a hobby that formed an </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"4\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　4　　　　</span><span> friendship between us.</span></span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>One sunny afternoon, feeling </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"5\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　5　　　　</span><span>, I decided to take a break from my studies. I </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"6\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　6　　　　</span><span> outside to my backyard garden where I began to weed alone. Mr. Jensen was there as usual, </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"7\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　7　　　　</span><span> his blossoming rosebushes.</span></span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>Seeing my frustration, he walked over and </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"8\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　8　　　　</span><span> started weeding alongside me. A few minutes later, he finally spoke up. “Weeding a garden is a lot like </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"9\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　9　　　　</span><span> life. Sometimes, we focus so much on the weeds — the problems and difficulties — that we forget to enjoy the </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"10\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　10　　　　</span><span>.”</span></span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>He gestured to the beautiful roses in his garden, their </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"11\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　11　　　　</span><span> colors shining in the sun. “Don’t forget to appreciate the roses, even as you deal with the weeds.” That simple </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"12\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　12　　　　</span><span> hit me hard. I had been so focused on my problems that I had forgotten to enjoy my </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"13\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　13　　　　</span><span> — the friendships, the joy of learning new things, and the beauty of nature.</span></span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>That day, Mr. Jensen taught me a lesson that I’ve </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"14\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　14　　　　</span><span> with me ever since. Now, whenever I find myself </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"15\"' size='\"9\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　15　　　　</span><span> by life’s “weeds”, I pause, take a deep breath, and remember to enjoy my “roses”.</span></span></p>",
