w-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3779103332532224/31f7537d9858c5e9a3d6f422d413c2ee.svg"/></p><p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">刚好浸没时，下表面距容器底的距离</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3779103332532224/571b44ea091c4422250f6dd8a843054f.svg"/></p><p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">开始运动到刚好浸没时运动的距离</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3779103332532224/da5680c141b2583ff4531707cf371354.svg"/></p><p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">的重力做功</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3779103332532224/f9cc26697af7c3f979e51bdde2cb141e.svg"/></p>"
