{
  "explanationSegs" : [ {
    "name" : "导语",
    "html" : "<p style='\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">本文是一篇说明文。文章主要介绍了中国</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> (</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">甚至可能是全世界</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>) </span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">最小的山</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>——</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">静山。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(1)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：在那里，你会发现静山，它是中国，甚至可能是全世界最小的山。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>highest</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">最高的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>largest</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">最大的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>smallest</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">最小的。根据上文</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“Do you know about China’s smallest mountain?”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，此处指最小的山。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(2)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：它高出地面仅</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>0.6</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">米。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>wide</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">宽的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>long</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">长的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>high</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">高的。根据</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“only 0.6 meters … above the ground”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，此处指山高出地面只有</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>0.6 </span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">米，描述山的高度用</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“high”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(3)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：人们只需迈出一小步，就能到达山顶。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>step</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">步；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>journey</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">旅程；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>risk</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">风险。根据语境可知，因为山很矮，所以人们只要迈一小步就能到达山顶。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(4)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：它可能不是中国最著名的山，但它是寿光市唯一的一座山。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>so</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">所以；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>but</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">但是；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>because</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">因为。分析句子结构可知，前后两句是转折关系，应用</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>but</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(5)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：它是这座城市的象征，也是最受欢迎的旅游景点之一。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>guest</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">客人；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>symbol</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">象征；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>hobby</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">爱好。根据上文</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“it’s the only mountain in Shouguang”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，静山是寿光唯一的山，所以这座山是这个城市的一个象征。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(6)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：因为政府现在阻止任何人在它周围挖掘。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>learns</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">学习；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>protects</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">保护；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>stops</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">阻止。根据上文</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“How deep is Jingshan embedded in the ground? We’ll probably never know.”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，我们可能永远不会知道静山在地下有多深，因为政府现在阻止任何人在它周围挖掘。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(7)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：事实上，在</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>20</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">世纪</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>50</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">年代，一些人试图在它周围挖掘，以证明它不是一座山，它只是一块岩石。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>rock</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">岩石；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>road</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">道路；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>chore</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">家务。根据上文</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“some people tried to dig around it to prove that it wasn’t a mountain”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，人们想证明它不是山，可能是一块岩石。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>A</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(8)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：然后，人们就认为它是中国最小的山。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>with</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">具有；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>for</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">为了；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>as</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">作为。根据空前</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“regarded it”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，此处考查</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>regard ... as ... “</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">把……看作</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，固定搭配。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(9)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：静山的照片在网上走红后，网上出现了各种各样的观点。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>safe</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">安全的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>popular</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">受欢迎的；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>modern</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">现代的。根据下文</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“all kinds of opinions appeared online”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，网上出现了各种各样的评论，所以此处指静山的照片在网上走红，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>popular</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">符合语境。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(10)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">句意：有人说他们想亲自去参观这座可爱的山。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>yourself</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">你自己；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>themselves</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">他们自己；</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>ourselves</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">我们自己。根据句中</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“Some”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">和</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“they”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">可知，此处是指</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">他们自己</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">来参观这座山，应用</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>themselves</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>B</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  } ]
}

