    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">氧化还原的配平原则主要为：</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(1)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">一标：标明反应前后化合价有变化的元素的化合价；</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(2)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">二等：通过求最小公倍数使化合价升降总值相等；</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(3)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">三定：确定氧化剂与还原剂的化学计量数；</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">氧化剂</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">还原剂</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">化学计量数</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>=</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">降</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">升</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价的最小公倍数</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>÷1mol</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">氧化剂</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">还原剂</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">降</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">升</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价总数；</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(4)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">四平：用观察法配平其他物质的化学计量数；</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>(5)</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">五查：检查质量与电荷、电子是否分别守恒；</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">单线桥法表示电子转移的方向与数目，从失电子的氧化剂指向得电子的还原剂，并表示出电子转移总数。</span></p><p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">按上述氧化还原反应的配平原则配好平后再利用单线桥法表示出电子转移的方向和数目即可。</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(1)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">反应中，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Zn</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">化合价从</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>0</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价升高到</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价，升高价态为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，硝酸中一部分</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>N</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">元素化合价从</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+5</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价降低到</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+1</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价，降低价态为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>4×2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，则</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Zn</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">与</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>N</span><sub>2</sub><span>O</span></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">的化学计量数之比为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>4:1</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，又硝酸还有一部分形成硝酸锌，结合原子守恒可配平上述反应为：</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/a3ebfacff7462698e13e616a090e108c.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；单线桥法表示如下：</span><img height='\"51\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/ca79d88f44bf48d5bc770839c426ecb6.png" width='\"274\"'/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(2)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">上述反应中，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">被氧化为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>CO</span><sub>2</sub></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，化合价升高</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>4</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>H</span><sub>2</sub><span>SO</span><sub>4</sub></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">中</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>S</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">元素转化为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>SO</span><sub>2</sub></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，从</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+6</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价降低到</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+4</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价，化合价降低</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，则</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>C</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">与浓</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>H</span><sub>2</sub><span>SO</span><sub>4</sub></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">的化学计量数之比为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>1:2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，根据原子守恒可知该反应的化学方程式为：</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/df675f74465d66fa1374c17f56abbc6d.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，转移电子数为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>4e</span><sup>-</sup></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，用单线桥法表示为：</span><img height='\"46\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/ef8c08ffc7f04ee8b128c53176764540.png" width='\"284\"'/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(3)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">上述反应中，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Al</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">被氧化为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>1</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">个</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/c80d9015ef1b9e7dee298b5cf0458ac3.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，化合价升高</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>6</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">个，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>FeO</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">中</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Fe</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">元素转化为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Fe</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">单质，从</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价降低到</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>0</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价，化合价降低</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，则</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/c80d9015ef1b9e7dee298b5cf0458ac3.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">与</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Fe</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">的化学计量数之比为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>1:3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，根据原子守恒可知该反应的化学方程式为：</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/01031d594683ebe81d3844e6828d37f1.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；反应中电子转移数为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>6e</span><sup>-</sup></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，单线桥表示为：</span><img height='\"49\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/18dc4874ae3b48b8a445572a2c5fdf7c.png" width='\"193\"'/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(4)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">上述反应氨气和</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NO</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">发生归中反应生成氮气，其中氨气中的</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>N</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">元素化合价升高</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，发生失电子的氧化反应，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NO</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">中的</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>N</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">元素化合价降低</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，发生得电子的还原反应，所以</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>NH</span><sub>3</sub></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">与</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NO</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">的化学计量数之比为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2:3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，根据原子守恒可配平该反应为：</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/44c9c73526d78a36f50e68f8d49423b5.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，电子转移总数为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>12e</span><sup>-</sup></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，利用单线桥法表示为：</span><img height='\"72\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/9cfc3443-bf83-45ed-a49b-ef42b935ff4e.png" width='\"228\"'/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(5)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/e6d42c4c1add1febe3099929775fc3e0.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">中</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Cr</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">元素从</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+6</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价降低到</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价，化合价降低</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>6</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，发生得电子的还原反应，</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/78074858e37b7253065c0e364414a94a.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">从</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价升高到</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价，升高</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>1</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，发生失电子的氧化反应，则</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/e6d42c4c1add1febe3099929775fc3e0.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">与</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/78074858e37b7253065c0e364414a94a.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">的化学计量数之比为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>1:6</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，再根据电荷守恒调节氢离子的化学计量数，最后结合原子守恒配平即可，其离子方程式为：</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/7970b9056d06108e78a3e5ba273c7154.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，电子转移总数为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>6e</span><sup>-</sup></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，</span><img height='\"60\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/f7eccb4a-e56d-4552-9364-b1816cf76cb9.png" width='\"298\"'/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(6)题详解",
    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/2a5c9f1df086b451bfb95630bd797693.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">转化为</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/16128f98db8ddcc2e3d29cd5ec318b73.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，其中的</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Fe</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">元素从</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价升高到</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+6</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">价，化合价升高</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/d2ea8ee9be4924eef1b207b37ad6a989.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">转化为</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/b5fcdd6114bdd31dd11d1819ca0c53aa.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，化合价降低</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，则还原剂</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/2a5c9f1df086b451bfb95630bd797693.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">与氧化剂</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/d2ea8ee9be4924eef1b207b37ad6a989.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">的化学计量数之比为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2:3</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，利用氢氧根离子调节电荷守恒，最后调节原子守恒配平为：</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/265185e9676d851bbdae70b54fcca394.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，电子转移总数为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><span>6e</span><sup>-</sup></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，单线桥表示如下：</span><img height='\"54\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2926237280149504/d58210d2-ec6c-4f08-8be7-1d5af64313aa.png" width='\"313\"'/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  } ]
}

