s="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>4</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">种试剂的使用顺序可以为</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>BaCl</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>2</span></sub><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NaOH</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Na</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>2</span></sub><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>CO</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>3</span></sub><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液或者是</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NaOH</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>BaCl</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>2</span></sub><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Na</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>2</span></sub><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>CO</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>3</span></sub><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液或者</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>BaCl</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>2</span></sub><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Na</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>2</span></sub><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>CO</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>3</span></sub><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NaOH</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">溶液；加入碳酸钠和钙离子反应生成沉淀，离子方程式为：</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3735970569158656/1e18846ec9f4312e7e93b3e60efa6d6f.svg"/><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+CO</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3735970569158656/2ec51523940a9cbe7e38ffd6591908d2.svg"/><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>=CaCO</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>3</span></sub><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>↓</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(2)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>a</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．过滤时漏斗末端颈尖应该紧靠烧杯壁，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>a</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">错误；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>b</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．转移液体时，玻璃棒用作引流，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>b</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">正确；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>c</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．将滤纸湿润，使其紧贴漏斗壁，防止有气泡，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>c</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">正确；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>d</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．用玻璃棒在漏斗中轻轻搅动容易弄碎滤纸，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>d</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">错误；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>ad</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(3)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>“</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">调滤液</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>pH”</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">为了除去过量的碳酸钠和氢氧化钠，即除去的离子有</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>CO</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3735970569158656/2ec51523940a9cbe7e38ffd6591908d2.svg"/><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>OH</span><sup new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>-</span></sup><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；之后的滤液通过蒸发结晶可以得到氯化钠，即之后的滤液倒入蒸发皿中；虑液蒸发至出现较多固体时，停止加热，利用蒸发皿的余热使滤液蒸干；</span></p>"
  }, {
    "name" : "(4)题详解",
    "html" : "<p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>a</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．容量瓶用蒸馏水洗后未干燥，不影响溶质的物质的量和溶液体积，所配制的</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NaCl</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">物质的量浓度无影响，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>a</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">错误；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>b</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．未洗涤烧杯和玻璃捧，导致溶质损失，所配制的</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NaCl</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">物质的量浓度偏低，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>b</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">正确；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>c</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．定容时俯视看到刻度线，溶液体积偏小，所配制的</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NaCl</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">物质的量浓度偏高，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>c</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">错误；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>d</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">．定容摇匀后发现液面低于刻度线，再加水直至刻度线，溶液体积偏大，所配制的</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>NaCl</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">物质的量浓度偏低，</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>d</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">正确；</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">故选</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>bd</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>"
  } ]
}

