  "html" : "<p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Do you like living in cities or villages? I work in Shanghai. People </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"1\"' size='\"8\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　1　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> it is a big and famous city. But it’s not easy for me </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"2\"' size='\"8\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　2　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> here. I don’t have much money to buy a house. So I have to rent (</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">租用</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>) one. The house is across </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"3\"' size='\"8\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　3　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> the train station. I can see trains come and go from my house. It’s noisy all day. I can’t sleep </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"4\"' size='\"8\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　4　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'> at night.</span></p><p 28px;\"="" style='\"text-indent:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>The traffic here is </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"5\"' size='\"8\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　5　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>, too. You can’t imagine that there are too many cars on the street. So it’s </span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"6\"' size='\"8\"' sq='\"true\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　6　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>for me t