><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>∴BD=AD，</span></p><p both;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>∵BC=1，</span></p><p both;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>∴AD+DC=1，</span></p><p both;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">设</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>CD=x</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，则</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>AD=1-x，AC=</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2071122925338624/f89eef3148f2d4d09379767b4af69132.svg"/><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>（1-x），</span></p><p both;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>∴AD</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><sup>2</sup></span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>=AC</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><sup>2</sup></span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+CD</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><sup>2</sup></span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，即（</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>1-x）</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><sup>2</sup></span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>=</span><img class='\"xkw-math-img\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/2071122925338624/56d266a04f3dc7483eddbc26c5e487db.svg"/><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>（1-x）</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><sup>2</sup></span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>+x</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'><sup>2</sup></span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" s