{
  "explanationSegs" : [ {
    "name" : "原文",
    "html" : " Hello everyone, my name is Jessica. There are many different interests and hobbies in the world. Today I want to talk about my hobbies. Swimming and writing are my favorite activities. I love to go swimming because swimming makes me feel free and relaxed. I started to learn to swim when I was only four years old. That’s a little bit early for a child to learn how to swim. People often go swimming in summer because it is a good way to stay cool. For me, I go swimming even in winter. In fact, the water in the pool isn’t that cold in winter. I hope one day I can be a good swimmer to take part in the competitions. As for writing, there are different kinds of ideas in my mind, so I often write them down and share them online. There are many fans online who love my magic stories. They often wait for the coming new pages. My hobbies bring me pleasure and make me relaxed and comfortable. I think they will be with me forever. "
  } ]
}

